        <referenceFunction amount="1.0" category="ventilation" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="Production of various components for a ventilation system with a nominal air flow rate of 5'000-20'000 m3/h at the air handling unit. Reference value of inventory is 1 m3/h nominal air flow of the air handling unit (at 2 m/s air speed in cross section of air filter or heat exchanger). The inventory is based on average data of 4 office buildings, 3 schools and 3 residential care homes with a total heated gross floor area of 61719 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 302190 m3/h, specific weight of the components: 0.17 kg/(m3/h), including average components for air valves, air intake, roof-hoods, dampers, fire dampers, silencers and sensors. The data represent a ventilation system mainly made of galvanized steel." includedProcesses="Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps and for heating the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for infrastructure of the production site included." infrastructureProcess="false" localCategory="ventilation" localName="Ventilation system, various components" localSubCategory="production of components" name="Ventilation system, various components" subCategory="production of components" unit="m3"/>
